a definition is part of the description if
    the definition has the term label a text.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the capability a text.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the purpose a text.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the condition a condition.
a rule is part of the description if
    the rule uses the definition a definition.
a definition is part of the description if
    the definition has the semantic flag a truth value.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the label a text.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the comment a text.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the title a text.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the description a text.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing conforms to a standard.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing is published by an agent.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing cites a resource.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the preferred label a text.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the explanation a text.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing is in the scheme a scheme.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the broader concept a concept.
an assessment is part of the description if
    the assessment results in an assessment statement.
an assessment statement is part of the description if
    the assessment statement has the judgement a text.
an assessment statement is part of the description if
    the assessment statement has the statement type a type.
an assessment statement is part of the description if
    the assessment statement has the interpretation a text.
a temporal specification is part of the description if
    the temporal specification has the date a date.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing concerns the service a service.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has the type a class.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has for a property the value a value.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing has for a property the resource a resource.
a thing is part of the description if
    the thing is identified by an address.
a property is part of the description if
    the values of the property have the datatype a datatype.
a property is part of the description if
    the texts of the property have no language.
a value is part of the description if
    the value the value has the datatype a datatype.
a text is part of the description if
    the text the text has no language.

% ---- the word lists of LOMO -----------------------------------------------
% A register writes a term of LOMO's word lists as a word (obligation,
% deadline, addresser, data ...). Their labels, in English, as the word lists
% give them (the authority table of roles of the Publications Office for the
% three roles).

obligation has the preferred label "Obligation".
permission has the preferred label "Permission".
prohibition has the preferred label "Prohibition".
right has the preferred label "Right".
deadline has the preferred label "Deadline".
validity has the preferred label "Validity".
starting point has the preferred label "Starting Point".
trigger has the preferred label "Trigger".
report has the preferred label "Report".
certificate has the preferred label "Certificate".
data has the preferred label "Data".
observation has the preferred label "Observation".
digital public service has the preferred label "Digital Public Service".
digital solutions has the preferred label "Digital Solution".
process automation has the preferred label "Process Automation".
data flow has the preferred label "Data Flow".
